Ultralytics (AGPL-3.0) - https://github.com/ultralytics/ultralytics
  * src/tracking/gm_cost.py     adapts BOTSORT.get_dists (IoU distance, score fusion, optional ReID branch).
  * src/tracking/nsa_kalman.py  adapts the update / re_activate methods of the BoT-SORT track so that the detection
                                confidence reaches the Kalman filter.
  * configs/trackers/*.yaml     are the default tracker configurations of Ultralytics 8.4.113 (the two blocks
                                appended to botsort_gm_nsa.yaml are specific to this repository).
  * The detector checkpoints released with this repository are YOLO26n weights fine-tuned with Ultralytics.

Other dependencies are used as libraries and are not redistributed: SAHI (MIT), py-motmetrics (MIT), PyTorch (BSD-3-Clause),
